{"slug":"infertility","title":"不孕症與人工生殖","subtitle":"Infertility and assisted reproduction — definition and classification, female factors (ovulatory, tubal, uterine, cervical, age) and male factors, diagnostic tests (ovulation tracking, hormones and AMH, hysterosalpingography, semen analysis), timing intercourse, ovulation induction, intrauterine insemination, IVF-ET and its steps, complications such as ovarian hyperstimulation and multiple pregnancy, Taiwan's Assisted Reproduction Act, and psychosocial nursing care","category":"care","aliases":["不孕症","不孕","Infertility","原發性不孕","繼發性不孕","女性不孕","男性不孕","男性不孕症","不孕症檢查","輸卵管攝影","子宮輸卵管攝影","HSG","抗穆勒氏管荷爾蒙","抗穆氏管荷爾蒙","AMH","卵巢庫存量","卵巢儲備","性交後試驗","人工生殖","人工生殖技術","ART","人工授精","人工受精","子宮內人工授精","IUI","試管嬰兒","體外受精","體外受精胚胎植入術","IVF-ET","IVF","單一精蟲顯微注射","ICSI","取卵","胚胎植入","囊胚植入","冷凍胚胎","禮物嬰兒","GIFT","ZIFT","排卵誘導","促排卵","黃體支持","卵巢過度刺激症候群","OHSS","減胎","精卵捐贈","人工生殖法","代理孕母"],"dzTags":["不孕症","男性不孕症"],"admTags":[],"system":"reproductive","alsoIn":["obstetrics"],"group":"reproductive-health","reviewed":false,"updated":"2026-10-27","references":[{"title":"華杏《產科護理學》第 16 章不孕症護理(書頁 773–791)","note":"僅作為撰寫參考，本頁文字與表格為重新整理撰寫"},{"title":"Practice Committee of the American Society for Reproductive Medicine. Definitions of infertility and recurrent pregnancy loss：a committee opinion. Fertil Steril 2020;113:533–535","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fertnstert.2019.11.025","note":"不孕症定義(12 個月；35 歲以上 6 個月)"},{"title":"人工生殖法(全國法規資料庫)","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=L0070024","note":"受術夫妻條件、捐贈人年齡、代理孕母未合法(條文細節寫在 maternal-child-health)"},{"title":"World Health Organization. WHO laboratory manual for the examination and processing of human semen, 6th ed. 2021","url":"https://www.who.int/publications/i/item/9789240030787","note":"精液分析採檢方式"},{"title":"國考歷屆題與 AI 詳解","note":"只用來判斷考點"}],"chapters":["產科-Ch02生殖系統及受孕 > 不孕症與人工生殖","產科-Ch13婦科常見疾病 > 常見的婦科手術、檢查及其護理"],"intro":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不孕症是夫妻共同的問題，檢查與治療都要兩人一起參與。本頁整理定義、男女雙方的原因、檢查、助孕的時機、人工授精與試管嬰兒的流程與併發症、人工生殖法，以及心理照護；排卵藥與黃體素的藥理見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"sex-hormones#infertility"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不孕症用藥"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"pituitary-hormones#gonadotropins"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"性腺激素與 GnRH 類似物"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，精液分析的數值見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"male-reproductive-system#semen-analysis"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"精液與精液分析"}]},{"type":"text","value":"。文中縮寫：AMH(Anti-Müllerian hormone，抗穆勒氏管激素)、HSG(Hysterosalpingography，子宮輸卵管攝影)、IUI(Intrauterine insemination，子宮內人工授精)、IVF-ET(In vitro fertilization and embryo transfer，體外受精胚胎植入術)、ICSI(Intracytoplasmic sperm injection，單一精蟲顯微注射)、OHSS(Ovarian hyperstimulation syndrome，卵巢過度刺激症候群)、hCG(human chorionic gonadotropin，人類絨毛膜促性腺激素)、FSH(Follicle-stimulating hormone，濾泡刺激素)"}]}]},"sections":[{"id":"summary","depth":2,"number":"一、","title":"重點摘要","children":[{"id":"exam-points","depth":3,"number":"(一)","title":"國考常考點","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"AMH "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不受月經週期影響"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，不用挑第 14 天抽；是評估卵巢庫存量的指標"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"精液收集用"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"自慰"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，不用一般保險套或性交中斷法；禁慾 2–7 天；保持室溫或體溫，"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不可冷藏"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"人工授精可用"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"新鮮精液或冷凍解凍的精液"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；禁慾約 2–5 天；注入後平躺約 10–15 分鐘即可(不用 12 小時)；約 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"2 週後"}]},{"type":"text","value":"驗孕(不是第 7 天)"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"人工授精的適應症"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不包括輸卵管阻塞"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"試管嬰兒步驟順序："},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"促卵泡成熟 → 偵測卵泡成熟度 → 注射 hCG 引發排卵 → 人工生殖技術 → 維持黃體期"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"國考答案：受精卵分裂到 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"2–8 個細胞"}]},{"type":"text","value":"時植入(第 2–3 天胚胎)；現在也常培養到第 5 天"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"囊胚"}]},{"type":"text","value":"再植入"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"助孕不需要"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"每天"}]},{"type":"text","value":"行房(國考答案認為錯誤)，排卵前後隔天一次即可；性交後墊枕抬高臀部、溝通彼此感受、觀察排卵期黏液變稀變多都正確"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"人工生殖法："},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"未婚者不可"}]},{"type":"text","value":"當受術者；禁止代理孕母；捐贈人不可是"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"四親等內旁系血親"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；男性捐贈人 20 歲以上未滿 50 歲"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"試管嬰兒失敗、個案否認結果時："},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"鼓勵表達感受與擔憂"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，詢問是否需要聯絡配偶，和醫療團隊一起討論後續；不要急著要她接受現實或叫她「再接再厲」"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]}]}}],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"定義：有規律、未避孕的性生活 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"12 個月"}]},{"type":"text","value":"仍未懷孕；女性 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"35 歲以上 6 個月"}]},{"type":"text","value":"就要評估(ASRM 2020)"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"原發性"}]},{"type":"text","value":"：從未懷孕；"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"繼發性"}]},{"type":"text","value":"：曾懷孕(不論結果)後無法再懷孕"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"原因約各 1/3："},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"女性"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"男性"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、雙方或"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"原因不明"}]},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"夫妻要一起檢查"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"女性："},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"chi